ric/ui/summ)\n    -   [Scoring Metric](https://www.clinicalgenome.org/docs/semi-quantitative-scoring-metric/)\n    \n    -   [File Downloads & APIs](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/downloads/#section_actionability)\n-   [Curated Variants](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/variant-pathogenicity/all)\n    -   [All Curations](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/variant-pathogenicity/all)\n    \n    -   [File Downloads & APIs](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/downloads#section_variant)\n-   [Statistics](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/reports/stats)\n-   [More](#)\n    -   [All Genes](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/genes)\n    -   [All Disease](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/conditions)\n    -   [All Drugs & Medications](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/drugs)\n    \n    -   [File Downloads & APIs](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/downloads)\n-   [](#)\n    -   [About ClinGen's Website](/tools/clingen-website-faq/)\n    -   [Learn About New Features](/docs/?doc-type=website-updates)\n    -   [How To Cite ClinGen](/tools/clingen-website-faq/how-to-cite/)\n    -   [External Data Attribution](/tools/clingen-website-faq/attribution/)\n    -   [Contact Us](/about/contact-clingen/)\n\n# Clinical Domain Working Groups\n\n[Back](https://clinicalgenome.org/working-groups/clinical-domain/reproduction-and-pregnancy-cdwg/)\n\n## Prenatal Gene Curation Expert Panel\n\n[Affiliated to **Reproduction and Pregnancy CDWG**](https://clinicalgenome.org/working-groups/clinical-domain/reproduction-and-pregnancy-cdwg/)\n\n[Membership](#heading_membership)\n\n---\n\nThis GCEP seeks to quantify the evidence supporting/not supporting the genes in which variants are purported to cause non-immune hydrops (NIHF), stillbirth, and additional severe prenatal phenotypes. We are pleased to be funded by U24 grants.\n\n[View all Gene-Disease Validity classifications approved by this GCEP.](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/affiliate/40106)\n\n#### Expert Panel Status *\\- Approved Expert Panel*\n\nStep 1\n\nStep 2\n\nDefine Group  \n*Complete*\n\nExpert Panel Approval  \n*Completed Oct. 2021*\n\n### Expert Panel Membership\n\nMembership spans many fields, including genetics, medical, academia, and industry.\n\n#### Chairs\n\n [![](/site/assets/files/11270/pwimg_egskbf.600x600.png ) **Wendy Chung MD, PhD**]( https://clinicalgenome.org/about/people/staff/chung-11270 )\n\n [![](/site/assets/files/11502/pwimg_ebi4pw.600x600.png ) **Igna Van den Veyver MD**]( https://clinicalgenome.org/about/people/staff/van-den-veyver-11502 )\n\n#### Coordinators\n\n [![](/site/templates/resources/img/defaults/user_square.png ) **Pinal Dalwadi BS**]( https://clinicalgenome.org/about/people/staff/dalwadi-11338 )\n\n [![](/site/assets/files/12211/pwimg_iy2f3t.600x600.png ) **Stephanie Galloway CGC**]( https://clinicalgenome.org/about/people/staff/galloway-12211 )\n\n [![](/site/templates/resources/img/defaults/user_square.png ) **Jessica Giordano MSc, CGC**]( https://clinicalgenome.org/about/people/staff/giordano-12210 )\n\n#### [Members (38)](#collapseMembersmembershipAccordion14136)\n\n [![](/site/assets/files/12227/pwimg_chkwry.600x600.png ) **Shagun Aggarwal MBBS, MD, DM**]( https://clinicalgenome.org/about/people/staff/aggarwal-12227 )\n\n [![](/site/assets/files/12224/pwimg_mkshkz.600x600.png ) **Caitlin Baptiste MD**]( https://clinicalgenome.org/about/people/staff/baptiste-12224 )\n\n [![](/site/templates/resources/img/defaults/user_square.png ) **Mara Black MD**]( https://clinicalgenome.org/about/people/staff/black-12226 )\n\n [![](/site/templates/resources/img/defaults/user_square.png ) **Brenna Boyd CGC**]( https://clinicalgenome.org/about/people/staff/boyd-12233 )\n\n [![](/site/templates/resources/img/defaults/user_square.png ) **Amanda Buchanan MSc, CGC**]( https://clinicalgenome.org/about/people/staff/buchanan-11867 )\n\n [![](/site/assets/files/11374/pwimg_xbk9dy.600x600.jpeg ) **Alicia Byrne, PhD**]( https://clinicalgenome.org/about