://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/affiliate/40106)\n    \n\n[\n\nSend Feedback\n\n](https://clinicalgenome.org/contact/share-feedback/?title=Prenatal%20Gene%20Curation%20Expert%20Panel&page=https%3A%2F%2Fclinicalgenome.org%2Faffiliation%2F40106%2F&ref=edwg)\n\n---\n\nThe information on this website is not intended for direct diagnostic use or medical decision-making without review by a genetics professional. Individuals should not change their health behavior solely on the basis of information contained on this website. If you have questions about the information contained on this website, please see a health care professional.\n\n---\n\n[@ClinGenResource](https://twitter.com/ClinGenResource)\n\n[youtube.com](https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCsn4nEVUTpVQz70rClgMMsQ)\n\n---\n\n[\n\n###### Get Started\n\n](https://clinicalgenome.org/start/)\n\n---\n\n[\n\n###### Curation Activities\n\n](https://clinicalgenome.org/curation-activities/)\n\n-   [About ClinGen's Curation Activities](https://clinicalgenome.org/curation-activities/about-curation-activities/)\n-   [Gene-Disease Validity](https://clinicalgenome.org/curation-activities/gene-disease-validity/)\n-   [Variant Pathogenicity](https://clinicalgenome.org/curation-activities/variant-pathogenicity/)\n-   [Clinical Actionability](https://clinicalgenome.org/curation-activities/clinical-actionability/)\n-   [Dosage Sensitivity](https://clinicalgenome.org/curation-activities/dosage-sensitivity/)\n-   [Somatic Cancer Variant](https://clinicalgenome.org/curation-activities/somatic/)\n-   [Baseline Annotation](https://clinicalgenome.org/curation-activities/baseline-annotation/)\n-   [ClinGen Curation of ClinVar](https://clinicalgenome.org/curation-activities/clingen-curation-of-clinvar/)\n-   [Browse All ClinGen's Curated Genes](https://clinicalgenome.org/curation-activities/results/)\n\n---\n\n[\n\n###### Tools\n\n](https://clinicalgenome.org/tools/)\n\n---\n\n[\n\n###### About Us\n\n](https://clinicalgenome.org/about/)\n\n-  